{
  "_about": "Every file in Dependencies/ that ships with TiXL, who uses it and under which licence. Installer/check-licences.py fails when a file is missing here or its licence is not allowed. builtInCi marks files a release build produces itself, so they are absent in a checkout. Licence texts live in licenses/.",
